      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. those are good starting points, but they feel a bit too \"textbook.\" my student is in a high-level circuit and needs to actually win the round. can you give me some more aggressive, hard-hitting rebuttals? like, don't just say \"critics argue\"—tell me how to actually dismantle the pro-UBI position and shut down their arguments effectively.",
